## Model card

- **Name:** LongCat 2.0
- **Short description:** Meituan's MIT-licensed open-weights 1.6T/48B MoE model for coding and agentic work, 1M context window. (unveiled 2026-06-29)
- **Provider / access:** LongCat API; open weights on HuggingFace
- **Release / knowledge:** Released June 29, 2026; knowledge cutoff not published
- **IDs:** `meituan/longcat-2.0` (per `meta.json`); `longcat-2-0` (AA slug); `longcat-2-0` (BenchLM slug)
- **Context window:** 1M total (per AA model page; `meta.json` also says 1M — **consistent**)
- **Modalities:** Text in/out (per AA model page: "Supports: text" and `meta.json`: "Text in/out" — **consistent**)
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-01):** $0.30 input / $1.20 output per 1M tokens (LongCat API); cache discount 98% (cache hit $0.006)
- **Architecture:** Mixture-of-Experts (MoE); 1.6 trillion total parameters, 48 billion active
- **License:** MIT (commercial use allowed)
- **Open weights:** Yes — [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/meituan-longcat/LongCat-2.0)
- **Reasoning:** Yes (extended thinking / chain-of-thinking)
- **Speed:** N/A (per AA)

